===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: User Management

DEVELOPER OWNER: Rjoub
MODULE: Administration
TRELLO TASK: User Management
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/UYxdWeUv

PURPOSE:
List every account with its roles, department (employees) or
company (suppliers) and active status.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Admin

ROUTE: /Admin/Users

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Query AspNetUsers with UserManager, including roles and
  Department/Supplier names.
- Server-side search, filters and paging.
- Deactivate with ApplicationUser.IsActive instead of
  deleting (history keeps foreign keys to users).
- Audit every role or status change.

DEPENDENCIES:
AspNetUsers, AspNetUserRoles, AspNetRoles, Departments,
